  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5909.011 EMS I General Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5909.011 EMS I General Requirements. Each applicant seeking licensure for an EMS I license shall complete a division approved instructor training program. The division shall approve instructor training programs that meets or exceeds any edition of the NFPA standard for Fire and Emergency Services Instructor I professional qualifications.\n\nSource. #13953, eff 4-30-24",
